{
  "version": "v22",
  "base": "v21",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "363845",
      "english": "Gargle often.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 13,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Rince souvent"
    },
    {
      "id": "363855",
      "english": "Gargle proud.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 13,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Avec fierté."
    },
    {
      "id": "363865",
      "english": "Gargle strong.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 14,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Avec force."
    },
    {
      "id": "363876",
      "english": "And if you catch a cold,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 24,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Et si tu prends froid,"
    },
    {
      "id": "3638AB",
      "english": "Here is some mouthwash I concocted myself.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 42,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Voici mon bain de bouche fait maison."
    },
    {
      "id": "3638D8",
      "english": "Take it!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Prends!"
    },
    {
      "id": "363A55",
      "english": "All right, here you go.",
      "refs": [
        "363A1B"
      ],
      "text_length": 23,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Très bien, tiens."
    },
    {
      "id": "363A6F",
      "english": "From now on, it'll cost you $10, though.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Mais désormais, ce sera 10 dollars."
    },
    {
      "id": "363B6F",
      "english": "I found this hat.",
      "refs": [
        "363B3C"
      ],
      "text_length": 17,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "J'ai trouvé ça."
    },
    {
      "id": "363B83",
      "english": "I think it belongs to a girl in Snowman.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Il doit être à une fille de Snowman."
    },
    {
      "id": "363BAE",
      "english": "Deliver it to her, if you'd be so kind.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 39,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Apporte-le-lui, s'il te plaît."
    },
    {
      "id": "363C52",
      "english": "Try getting rid of something.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 29,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Essaie de jeter un objet."
    },
    {
      "id": "363CDD",
      "english": "The train can't get through until it has been removed.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 54,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Le train ne passera qu'une fois cet obstacle retiré."
    },
    {
      "id": "363D16",
      "english": "Well, I don't know how far the train goes through,",
      "refs": [
        "363CAD"
      ],
      "text_length": 50,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je ne sais pas jusqu'où va cette ligne de train,"
    },
    {
      "id": "364044",
      "english": "Go ahead,",
      "refs": [
        "364039"
      ],
      "text_length": 9,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Vas-y,"
    },
    {
      "id": "36407F",
      "english": "It's what makes playing the game so fun.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "C'est ce qui rend le jeu si amusant."
    },
    {
      "id": "36422C",
      "english": "I wouldn't do that,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 19,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je ne ferais pas ça"
    },
    {
      "id": "3643C4",
      "english": "Cough, cough.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 13,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Touss, touss."
    },
    {
      "id": "36460F",
      "english": "I'm a little busy right now.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Je suis un peu occupé."
    },
    {
      "id": "364662",
      "english": "Pardon me, young whippersnappers...",
      "refs": [
        "20459E"
      ],
      "text_length": 35,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Excusez-moi, jeunes garnements..."
    },
    {
      "id": "3649AF",
      "english": "If you see her, let me know immediately!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Si tu la vois, préviens-moi aussitôt!"
    },
    {
      "id": "3649EC",
      "english": "Just hold onto this money for me.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 33,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Garde cet argent pour moi."
    },
    {
      "id": "364B62",
      "english": "A cold's been going around lately...",
      "refs": [
        "20467B"
      ],
      "text_length": 36,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Un rhume circule ces derniers temps."
    },
    {
      "id": "364BB0",
      "english": "Give me something.",
      "refs": [
        "20469D"
      ],
      "text_length": 18,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Donne-moi un truc."
    },
    {
      "id": "364BC5",
      "english": "Whatever it is,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 15,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "N'importe quoi,"
    },
    {
      "id": "364C13",
      "english": "Why won't you give it to me?",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Pourquoi ne pas me le donner"
    },
    {
      "id": "364C61",
      "english": "I promise, I'll give you something in return.",
      "refs": [
        "364C54"
      ],
      "text_length": 45,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Promis, tu auras quelque chose en échange."
    },
    {
      "id": "364D02",
      "english": "Thanks a lot.",
      "refs": [
        "364CCD"
      ],
      "text_length": 13,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Merci bien."
    },
    {
      "id": "364D12",
      "english": "In return, here are some fleas and lice.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "En échange, voici des puces et des poux."
    },
    {
      "id": "364E88",
      "english": "Whoa...!!!",
      "refs": [
        "2046BF"
      ],
      "text_length": 10,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Oh là...!"
    },
    {
      "id": "364ECA",
      "english": "For college credit.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 19,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Pour mes études."
    },
    {
      "id": "364F37",
      "english": "I walked through the tunnel once when I was young.",
      "refs": [
        "2046E1"
      ],
      "text_length": 50,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "J'ai traversé ce tunnel une fois, étant jeune."
    },
    {
      "id": "364F6C",
      "english": "My friends and I all got together,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Mes amis et moi étions réunis,"
    },
    {
      "id": "364FBE",
      "english": "Somewhere in the town of Spookane...",
      "refs": [
        "2046F2"
      ],
      "text_length": 36,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Quelque part dans Spookane..."
    },
    {
      "id": "364FE5",
      "english": "I heard that there's a...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 25,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Il paraît qu'il y a un..."
    },
    {
      "id": "365012",
      "english": "ghost...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "fantôme"
    },
    {
      "id": "36502E",
      "english": "Don't you dare ever go there!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 29,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "N'ose jamais aller là-bas!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36504E",
      "english": "Have you ever thrown food away when you're carrying too many things?",
      "refs": [
        "204703"
      ],
      "text_length": 68,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "As-tu déjà jeté de la nourriture faute de place dans tes affaires?"
    },
    {
      "id": "3650D7",
      "english": "Mooooooooo.",
      "refs": [
        "203E0C"
      ],
      "text_length": 11,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Meuuuuuh."
    },
    {
      "id": "3650E5",
      "english": "(I just say what any typical cow says.)",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 39,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "(Je dis ce que dit une vache normale.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "36510F",
      "english": "(Cowabunga!)",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 12,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "(Meuh alors)"
    },
    {
      "id": "367CAB",
      "english": "To use properly, be sure to save and turn OFF the power.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 56,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Pour bien l'utiliser, sauvegarde et ÉTEINS la console."
    },
    {
      "id": "36969B",
      "english": "I'm so lonesome,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 16,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je suis si seul,"
    },
    {
      "id": "369845",
      "english": "Oh, the darkness is so thick...",
      "refs": [
        "203C41"
      ],
      "text_length": 31,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "L'obscurité est si épaisse..."
    },
    {
      "id": "369867",
      "english": "I can't see you very well.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 26,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je te vois mal."
    },
    {
      "id": "3698C4",
      "english": "Is that the little girl from Snowman?",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 37,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "C'est la fillette de Snowman?"
    },
    {
      "id": "369907",
      "english": "Brace yourselves,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 17,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Préparez-vous,"
    },
    {
      "id": "369947",
      "english": "Do not try to rescue us now.",
      "refs": [
        "369889",
        "369892",
        "36989D",
        "3698AD"
      ],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "N'essayez pas de nous sauver"
    },
    {
      "id": "369966",
      "english": "First, the mothership must be destroyed.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Détruisez d'abord le vaisseau mère."
    },
    {
      "id": "369D9B",
      "english": "I always believed that you could make it this far.",
      "refs": [
        "369D03"
      ],
      "text_length": 50,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "J'ai toujours cru que tu arriverais jusque-là."
    },
    {
      "id": "369E06",
      "english": "Scattered in the form of melodies.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Éparpillés sous forme de mélodies."
    },
    {
      "id": "369ED7",
      "english": "Scattered in the form of melodies.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Éparpillés sous forme de mélodies."
    },
    {
      "id": "369EFC",
      "english": "Sing those melodies to others so they can feel Maria's love.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 60,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Chante ces mélodies pour transmettre l'amour de Maria."
    },
    {
      "id": "36A000",
      "english": "I HAVE BEEN WAITING FOR YOU.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "JE T'ATTENDAIS."
    },
    {
      "id": "36A04E",
      "english": "HE WAS TAKEN TO THE ENDS OF THE UNIVERSE...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 43,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "IL FUT EMMENÉ AUX CONFINS DE L'UNIVERS..."
    },
    {
      "id": "36A09A",
      "english": "I AM HERE TO PROTECT YOU.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 25,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "JE VEILLE SUR TOI."
    },
    {
      "id": "36A286",
      "english": "How happy I am that you came all this way!",
      "refs": [
        "205946"
      ],
      "text_length": 42,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Quel bonheur que tu sois venu jusqu'ici!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36A2B3",
      "english": "I know what you'd like me to do.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 32,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je sais ce que tu attends de moi"
    },
    {
      "id": "36A434",
      "english": "You're right.",
      "refs": [
        "36A430"
      ],
      "text_length": 13,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu as raison."
    },
    {
      "id": "36A444",
      "english": "Now isn't the time...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 21,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Pas maintenant..."
    },
    {
      "id": "36A604",
      "english": "You gotta be kiddin' me!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 24,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu te moques de moi!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36DC9C",
      "english": "The train can't get through until it has been removed.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 54,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Le train ne passera qu'une fois cet obstacle retiré."
    },
    {
      "id": "36DCD5",
      "english": "Well, I don't know how far the train goes through,",
      "refs": [
        "36DC6C"
      ],
      "text_length": 50,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je ne sais pas jusqu'où va cette ligne de train,"
    },
    {
      "id": "36DFF6",
      "english": "I was on my way to Youngtown to look for my wife.",
      "refs": [
        "203CC9"
      ],
      "text_length": 49,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "J'allais à Youngtown pour chercher ma femme."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E19E",
      "english": "Surely, our pleas will be heard in the near future.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 51,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Nos prières seront sûrement bientôt entendues."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E31E",
      "english": "All of the grown ups in town are missing.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 41,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tous les adultes ont disparu de la ville."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E3BA",
      "english": "Even now, somehow I just know you can bring them back.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 54,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Même maintenant, je sais que tu peux les ramener."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E5A7",
      "english": "I needed your help...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 21,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "J'avais besoin de toi"
    },
    {
      "id": "36E5BF",
      "english": "So I've been waiting for you,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 29,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Alors je t'attendais,"
    },
    {
      "id": "36E633",
      "english": "Good-bye...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 11,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Adieu..."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E641",
      "english": "Next time, mommy will come back with us!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "La prochaine fois, maman nous suivra!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36E738",
      "english": "It's freezing here in Snowman.",
      "refs": [
        "203D73"
      ],
      "text_length": 30,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Il gèle ici, à Snowman."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E759",
      "english": "Try not to catch a cold.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 24,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Ne prends pas froid."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E774",
      "english": "Brush your teeth, too.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Brosse-toi les dents."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E854",
      "english": "I am so worried, I can't sleep!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 31,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Je m'inquiète trop pour dormir!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36E89A",
      "english": "I'm so worried...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 17,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Je m'inquiète..."
    },
    {
      "id": "36E9E7",
      "english": "But, I'll bet you already knew that.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 36,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Mais je parie que tu le savais déjà."
    },
    {
      "id": "36EA0E",
      "english": "There's a chateau in the mountains further to the east.",
      "refs": [
        "203D1E"
      ],
      "text_length": 55,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Il y a un château dans les montagnes plus à l'est."
    },
    {
      "id": "36EA68",
      "english": "You kids are crazy.",
      "refs": [
        "203D2F"
      ],
      "text_length": 19,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Vous êtes fous."
    },
    {
      "id": "36EA7E",
      "english": "Running around with just T-shirts on.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 37,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Courir partout en simple T-shirt."
    },
    {
      "id": "36ED3A",
      "english": "So, you say you don't want it... Hmmmm...",
      "refs": [
        "365EF8"
      ],
      "text_length": 41,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Donc, tu n'en veux pas... Hmmmm..."
    },
    {
      "id": "36ED67",
      "english": "You can't afford that!",
      "refs": [
        "365FB0"
      ],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu n'as pas les moyens"
    },
    {
      "id": "36EDF1",
      "english": "Oh well.",
      "refs": [
        "366290"
      ],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tant pis"
    },
    {
      "id": "36EDFD",
      "english": "I can't buy stuff from you if you have nothing to sell me.",
      "refs": [
        "366348"
      ],
      "text_length": 58,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je ne peux rien t'acheter si tu n'as rien à vendre."
    },
    {
      "id": "36EE5C",
      "english": "Thanks a bunch!",
      "refs": [
        "3664B8"
      ],
      "text_length": 15,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Merci bien!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36EF32",
      "english": "All of these?",
      "refs": [
        "366798"
      ],
      "text_length": 13,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tout ça?"
    },
    {
      "id": "36EF43",
      "english": "Sorry, you don't have enough to pay for all of these.",
      "refs": [
        "366850"
      ],
      "text_length": 53,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Désolé, tu n'as pas assez pour payer tout ça."
    },
    {
      "id": "36EF7C",
      "english": "That's too many for you to carry.",
      "refs": [
        "366908"
      ],
      "text_length": 33,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu ne peux pas porter autant."
    },
    {
      "id": "36EFA1",
      "english": "Oh, okay.",
      "refs": [
        "3669C0"
      ],
      "text_length": 9,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Ah, OK."
    },
    {
      "id": "36EFAE",
      "english": "Woah, hey!",
      "refs": [
        "365887"
      ],
      "text_length": 10,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Oh, hé!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36F109",
      "english": "Don't need that,",
      "refs": [
        "365EFF"
      ],
      "text_length": 16,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Pas besoin,"
    },
    {
      "id": "36F134",
      "english": "Oh bummer. You don't got the cash.",
      "refs": [
        "365FB7"
      ],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Ah mince. Tu n'as pas les sous."
    },
    {
      "id": "36F15A",
      "english": "You're all full up, dude!",
      "refs": [
        "36606F"
      ],
      "text_length": 25,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "T'es déjà chargé, mec!"
    },
    {
      "id": "36F1EE",
      "english": "I'm sure you really need that.",
      "refs": [
        "366297"
      ],
      "text_length": 30,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu en as sûrement besoin."
    },
    {
      "id": "36F210",
      "english": "I don't think you have anything that you can sell.",
      "refs": [
        "36634F"
      ],
      "text_length": 50,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je ne crois pas que tu aies quelque chose à vendre"
    },
    {
      "id": "36F246",
